WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.775
[Uplifting, energetic instrumental music]
So much to do. Where does it all go?

00:02.775 --> 00:07.650
The penguin brings sticky notes into the task list.
Give scattered tasks a place together.

00:07.650 --> 00:10.950
Drag “Write a proposal” onto the calendar.
Make time for what matters.

00:10.950 --> 00:13.575
Move the time block to reschedule it.
Plans change. Your schedule can too.

00:13.575 --> 00:15.300
Check off a completed task.
One task done. A little lighter.

00:15.300 --> 00:18.000
Start the focus timer.
Find your pace. Get things done.
